            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "MOAC Mall Holdings LLC v. Transform Holdco LLC (No.\u202f21\u20111270) was argued on December\u202f5,\u202f2022 and decided on April\u202f19,\u202f2023."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ee6e08cf4391831e6dec252e0ed2eedfc3afa07c1debfc5b045b4e9f98e3a74",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6ee6e08cf439-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The central legal question was whether \u00a7363(m) is a jurisdictional provision."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "case_id": "2022-21-1270",
  "decision": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ee6e08cf4391831e6dec252e0ed2eedfc3afa07c1debfc5b045b4e9f98e3a74",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6ee6e08cf439-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that \u00a7363(m) is not a jurisdictional provision."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ee6e08cf4391831e6dec252e0ed2eedfc3afa07c1debfc5b045b4e9f98e3a74",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6ee6e08cf439-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court noted that labeling a provision jurisdictional carries severe consequences, including dismissal when a jurisdictional precondition is unmet."
      }
    ],
