            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked which provision the petitioner relies on to challenge the lease assignment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether the argument depends on issues that do not go to the authorization of the sale or lease."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch expressed confusion about whether a good\u2011faith purchaser of a bankruptcy asset might later have to disgorge it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked a counsel member to make an assumption they did not want to make."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Jackson, justice Jackson inquired whether \u00a7363(m) contemplates circumstances that would require it to be unraveled after a sale made in good faith."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 66,
              "start": 66
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked where the clear statement in \u00a7363(m) that would make it jurisdictional is located."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 69,
              "start": 69
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch questioned whether \u201cmagic words\u201d like \u201cno jurisdiction\u201d are required in in\u2011rem actions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 70,
              "start": 70
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Jackson asked whether a sale made in good faith can be touched."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "808b7a2483191fac3e3f79e0be5b48fff808def10cdfc55a6781b101b100d24b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-808b7a248319-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 72,
              "start": 72
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether a common\u2011law rule allows a good\u2011faith buyer of a bankruptcy asset to still challenge the sale."
      }
    ],
